1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:09,230
The Analytics tab shows how your trading is going.

2
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:20,840
These buttons pick the time period, from one day to all time.

3
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:25,900
The top row sums it up: profit, win rate, trades and risk.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,460
The calendar shows your profit or loss day by day.

5
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:35,520
Health Score gives a quick AI read of your account.

6
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:41,520
Click a day to see what happened on that day.

7
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:47,340
The details for that day open underneath.

8
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:53,160
The equity curve shows how your account value moved.

9
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:59,990
Further down: monthly results, your win rate and your most traded pairs.

10
00:01:00,090 --> 00:01:04,490
And your profit for each day, plus how long you hold your trades.

